  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring and improving crop and livestock-based livelihoods of IDPs, Returnees, Vulnerable Resident Population and Refugees in South Darfur, West Darfur, North Darfur and West Kordofan states</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the capacity of 98,000 vulnerable households (570,000 people) to access, through crop and livestock-based livelihood interventions, sufficient nutritious food and diversify their food basket and improve their income in the four targeted localities in South Darfur, North Darfur, West Darfur and West Kordofan states</narrative>
  </description>
